+/**
+ * REFACTOR: This function now calls the C++ proxy (`dashboardAiChatProxy`)
+ * instead of using fetch() directly. This is necessary to bypass
+ * the browser's security policy for chrome:// pages.
+ *
+ * @param {object} config - Configuration object with element IDs.
+ * @param {string} config.historyElId
